      <h2 class="text-[1.45rem] font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">About Sacred Heart of Jesus with Thorns and Flame</h2>
      <div id="details-summary">
        <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-8 text-slate-600 sm:text-[16px]">This powerful religious icon depicts the Sacred Heart of Jesus, rendered in deep red with visible anatomical detail, pierced by a golden lance and encircled by a crown of thorns. Above, flames rise toward a black cross, all set against radiant golden rays. The imagery is deeply symbolic of divine love, sacrifice, and devotion. Perfect for Catholic websites, church bulletins, religious education materials, spiritual social media graphics, faith-based promotions, prayer cards, or themed campaigns around mercy, redemption, or devotion. Also works well in reaction content, devotional blogs, or as a visual anchor in spiritual lifestyle content. Its dramatic composition and emotional weight make it instantly recognizable and impactful for audiences seeking spiritual connection or religious expression.</p>
